<title>UK: UK non-refining raw beet sugar exports down in Oct.</title>
<headline>UK non-refining raw beet sugar exports down in Oct.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-01-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>UK raw beet sugar exports in tonnes issued by UK Customs - Raw beet sugar not for refining.</p>
<p>				   OCT	  SEP    JAN/OCT 1996</p>
<p>  TOTAL			  146	  217	 3,324</p>
<p>  Belgium-Luxembourg	 nil	   83	 1,918</p>
<p>  Germany			nil	    2	     6</p>
<p>  Italy			   46	   46	   234</p>
<p>  Ireland			 78	   73	   995</p>
<p>  Spain			   21	   12	   169</p>
